1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,620
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) He slices up tofu in ten pieces.

2
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:07,380
He puts the pan on the stove.

3
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:10,480
He turns on the stove.

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,200
He puts oil in the pan.

5
00:00:15,239 --> 00:00:17,860
He puts the tofu in the pan.

6
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:22,280
He waits for the tofu to turn brown.

7
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:25,660
He flips over the tofu.

8
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:29,020
Now the other side is frying.

9
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:33,320
He waits for the tofu to turn brown

10
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:33,940
again.

11
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,980
He turns off the stove.
